    "scope": "6 of 8 MemHint projects (Vim, tmux, Redis, curl, OpenSSL, FreeRDP) — FFmpeg and linux/staging skipped as stretch/optional per plan (large codebase, high build/audit cost, low ROI for the case-count target).",
